@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@notebookId = replace-with-created-id

### 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz

### 就绪检查（探测 PostgreSQL）
GET {{baseUrl}}/readyz

### 创建笔记
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notebooks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "第一篇笔记",
  "content": "Hello, Go Web!"
}

### 列出笔记
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notebooks?limit=20&offset=0

### 获取单篇笔记
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notebooks/{{notebookId}}

### 部分更新笔记
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notebooks/{{notebookId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "更新后的标题"
}

### 删除笔记
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notebooks/{{notebookId}}
